  "title": "将数组排序的最少替换次数",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-034",
  "studyTags": [
    "数组",
    "数学",
    "贪心"
  ],
  "summary": "每次可把一个正整数替换成两个和等于它的正整数，求使最终数组非递减的最少操作数。",
  "insight": "从右向左维护当前元素各拆分部分允许的最大值 limit。若 value>limit，至少要拆成 parts=ceil(value/limit) 份，操作数加 parts-1；为让左侧最宽松，均匀拆分后新的最大允许值取 floor(value/parts)。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "一次拆成 parts 份需要 parts-1 次二分替换",
    "必须从右向左贪心",
    "操作数可能超过 int"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "right-to-left-balanced-splitting",
      "title": "从右向左均匀拆分",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用右侧最小首项约束当前拆分后的每一份。",
      "steps": [
        "limit=最后元素、answer=0",
        "从倒数第二项向左",
        "parts=ceil(value/limit)，answer+=parts-1",
        "limit=floor(value/parts)",
        "返回 answer"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/right-to-left-balanced-splitting/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/right-to-left-balanced-splitting/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/right-to-left-balanced-splitting/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
